OL,3,GNEWSADriver in his 90s arrested after
OL,4,Apedestrian dies
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man in his 90s has been arrested
OL,7,Fafter a pedestrian died in a collision
OL,8,Fwith a car in Worcestershire.
OL,10,FThe pedestrian, a man in his 80s, was
OL,11,Fwalking near the junction of Hoo Road
OL,12,Fand Forester Way in Kidderminster when
OL,13,Fhe was involved in the collision on
OL,14,FTuesday, according to West Mercia
OL,15,FPolice.
OL,17,FWest Midlands Ambulance Service said it
OL,18,Fwas called to the scene at 10:09 BST
OL,19,Fand sent an ambulance and the Midlands
OL,20,FAir Ambulance.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
