OL,3,GNEWSADriver in his 90s arrested after
OL,4,Apedestrian dies
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmbulance crews found bystanders
OL,7,Fperforming CPR on the man before taking
OL,8,Fover resuscitation efforts and giving
OL,9,Fhim advanced life support, but he died
OL,10,Fat the scene.
